# F8 test: a config that exercises the PID sample window.
#
# The heater test harness only inspects the exit status of the klippy run, so
# it cannot check the PID arithmetic; test/unit/test_heaters.py does that.
# What this run proves is that the option is accepted, that it is accepted on
# extruder/heater_bed/heater_generic alike, that it is accepted alongside its
# absence on other heaters, and that the whole temperature loop still runs.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG heater_pid_samples.cfg

M105

M104 S100
M105

M140 S60
SET_HEATER_TEMPERATURE HEATER=chamber TARGET=50
M105

M140 S0
M104 S0
SET_HEATER_TEMPERATURE HEATER=chamber TARGET=0
TURN_OFF_HEATERS
M105
